		(descr "ADF5904, 32-lead LFCSP_WQ 5x5mm (CP-32-12), 0.5mm pitch, EP 3.60mm sq (datasheets/extracted/adf5904.md Fig.22 p.15; 'shares ADF5901 LFCSP land'). Land pattern extrapolated per ADI AN-772 LFCSP design guide identically to ADF5901 (same package/pitch/EP): land length=lead length(0.40mm)+0.10mm toe growth=0.50mm; land width capped at AN-772 X_MAX=0.28mm for 0.5mm pitch. Verified against ADI AN-772 (Rev.0) Table I-III; no separate ADI CP-32-12 recommended-land drawing located distinct from the CP-32 family outline PDFs (fetch timed out) so the AN-772-derived extrapolation is retained per Task 3 disclosure. Thermal via grid 3x3 @1.2mm pitch, 0.3mm drill/0.6mm pad. EP paste windowed 4-quadrant, 70% coverage.")
